### 4.1 FastAPI Exception Handlers

In FastAPI, use exception handlers to manage errors globally:

```python
from fastapi import FastAPI, Request
from fastapi.responses import JSONResponse

app = FastAPI()

@app.exception_handler(ApiBaseException)
async def api_exception_handler(request: Request, exc: ApiBaseException):
    return JSONResponse(
        status_code=exc.status_code,
        content={
            "error": {
                "code": exc.error_code,
                "title": exc.error_title,
                "message": exc.message,
                "details": exc.details,
            }
        },
    )
```

