### 4.2 Error Response Format

All error responses should adhere to this structure:

```json
{
    "error": {
        "code": "ERROR_CODE",
        "title": "Error Title",
        "message": "A description of the error",
        "details": {
            "field": "Invalid value",
            "resource": "User"
        }
    }
}
```

